# Format workflow (font-ieee.mdc)

Apply `.cursor/rules/font-ieee.mdc` **section by section** on **Elsevier elsarticle**
`main.tex`. No Persian reports—**edit the file**.

## Default: one agent

| Agent | Action |
|-------|--------|
| **format-editor-fast** | Read section + rules → apply elsarticle-safe fixes in `main.tex` |

Optional: **format-strategist** only if user wants audit-without-edit first.

## Section order (one per round)

1. Abstract + Keywords
2. §1 Introduction → §7 Conclusion
3. Optional full pass (`Figure` → `Fig.`)

## User prompt

```
format-editor-fast: apply font-ieee.mdc to [Section name] in main.tex.
Edit directly; brief English reply only.
```

## Do not overlap

- **punctuation-editor-fast** — dashes, `\,`, `vs.\`
- **prose-editor-fast** — wording
- **format-editor-fast** — Fig./Table refs, math variables, Latin, emphasis

Compile on Overleaf after each section.
